                the loop preheader, which sits inside the first RAS-low window of every
                row. On the 4416 that window measured 10.62 us against a 10 us limit while
                the steady ones sat at 8.69 us -- 512 out-of-spec windows per run, present
                since long before this version and hidden under a larger ISR artefact.
                Hoisting it out (mix8r) leaves 3.
